# Allow-list: only what the image needs reaches the build context.
*
!requirements.txt
!src/
!config/
!web/
# The web build imports the privacy policy as text.
!docs/PRIVACY.md

# Never send these even inside allowed directories
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
web/coverage/
